cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HybridInfer (Python): reliability-aware local-first LLM router"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Simran
    family-names: Koul
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimranKoul2026/HybridInfer-Python-tool"
abstract: >-
  A reliability-aware LLM router that runs each request on a local model
  (via Ollama) and automatically falls back to a remote OpenAI-compatible
  model when local inference stalls, crashes, or is predicted to fail.
  Ships as an OpenAI-compatible server, a CLI, and a Python library.
keywords:
  - llm
  - local-llm
  - ollama
  - routing
  - reliability
  - fallback
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.1
date-released: "2026-09-02"
